{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 40,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 422.601,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.254,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now my son,",
      "verse": "40:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 1.434,
      "end": 4.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "here is somewhat more I would say unto thee;",
      "verse": "40:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 4.4,
      "end": 8.858,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I perceive that thy mind is worried concerning the resurrection of the dead.",
      "verse": "40:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 9.538,
      "end": 12.835,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I say unto you that there is no resurrection\u2014",
      "verse": "40:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 13.015,
      "end": 15.105,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or, I would say, in other words,",
      "verse": "40:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 15.285,
      "end": 18.35,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that this mortal does not put on immortality,",
      "verse": "40:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 18.53,
      "end": 23.128,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "this corruption does not put on incorruption\u2014 until after the coming of Christ.",
      "verse": "40:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 23.808,
      "end": 27.198,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, he bringeth to pass the resurrection of the dead.",
      "verse": "40:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 27.378,
      "end": 30.025,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, my son, the resurrection is not yet.",
      "verse": "40:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 30.205,
      "end": 32.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, I unfold unto you a mystery;",
      "verse": "40:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 32.939,
      "end": 36.376,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, there are many mysteries which are kept,",
      "verse": "40:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 36.556,
      "end": 39.203,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that no one knoweth them save God himself.",
      "verse": "40:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 39.383,
      "end": 43.377,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But I show unto you one thing which I have inquired diligently of God",
      "verse": "40:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 43.557,
      "end": 45.136,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might know\u2014",
      "verse": "40:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 45.316,
      "end": 47.638,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that is concerning the resurrection.",
      "verse": "40:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 48.318,
      "end": 50.64,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, there is a time appointed",
      "verse": "40:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 50.82,
      "end": 53.096,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that all shall come forth from the dead.",
      "verse": "40:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 53.276,
      "end": 55.552,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when this time cometh no one knows;",
      "verse": "40:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 55.732,
      "end": 58.379,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but God knoweth the time which is appointed.",
      "verse": "40:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 59.059,
      "end": 63.424,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, whether there shall be one time, or a second time, or a third time,",
      "verse": "40:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 63.604,
      "end": 67.133,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that men shall come forth from the dead, it mattereth not;",
      "verse": "40:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 67.313,
      "end": 69.403,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for God knoweth all these things;",
      "verse": "40:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 69.583,
      "end": 72.555,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it sufficeth me to know that this is the case\u2014",
      "verse": "40:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 72.735,
      "end": 75.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there is a time appointed",
      "verse": "40:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 75.33,
      "end": 77.838,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that all shall rise from the dead.",
      "verse": "40:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 78.518,
      "end": 80.515,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now there must needs be a space",
      "verse": "40:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 80.695,
      "end": 83.992,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "betwixt the time of death and the time of the resurrection.",
      "verse": "40:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 84.672,
      "end": 92.195,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I would inquire what becometh of the souls of men from this time of death to the time appointed for the resurrection?",
      "verse": "40:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 92.875,
      "end": 97.565,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now whether there is more than one time appointed for men to rise it mattereth not;",
      "verse": "40:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 97.745,
      "end": 101.507,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for all do not die at once, and this mattereth not;",
      "verse": "40:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 101.687,
      "end": 103.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all is as one day with God,",
      "verse": "40:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 103.864,
      "end": 106.372,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and time only is measured unto men.",
      "verse": "40:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 107.052,
      "end": 109.56,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, there is a time appointed",
      "verse": "40:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 109.74,
      "end": 112.573,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto men that they shall rise from the dead;",
      "verse": "40:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 112.753,
      "end": 117.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there is a space between the time of death and the resurrection.",
      "verse": "40:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 117.716,
      "end": 120.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, concerning this space of time,",
      "verse": "40:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 120.264,
      "end": 127.741,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "what becometh of the souls of men is the thing which I have inquired diligently of the Lord to know;",
      "verse": "40:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 127.921,
      "end": 130.104,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this is the thing of which I do know.",
      "verse": "40:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 130.784,
      "end": 133.849,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when the time cometh when all shall rise,",
      "verse": "40:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 134.029,
      "end": 138.162,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then shall they know that God knoweth all the times which are appointed unto man.",
      "verse": "40:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 138.842,
      "end": 143.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, concerning the state of the soul between death and the resurrection\u2014",
      "verse": "40:11",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 143.573,
      "end": 152.443,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, it has been made known unto me by an angel, that the spirits of all men, as soon as they are departed from this mortal body,",
      "verse": "40:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 152.623,
      "end": 156.57,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, the spirits of all men, whether they be good or evil,",
      "verse": "40:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 156.75,
      "end": 159.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are taken home to that God who gave them life.",
      "verse": "40:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 160.17,
      "end": 163.142,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then shall it come to pass that the spirits of those",
      "verse": "40:12",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 163.322,
      "end": 167.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who are righteous are received into a state of happiness,",
      "verse": "40:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 167.403,
      "end": 171.675,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is called paradise, a state of rest, a state of peace,",
      "verse": "40:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 171.855,
      "end": 177.149,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "where they shall rest from all their troubles and from all care, and sorrow.",
      "verse": "40:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 177.829,
      "end": 181.405,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then shall it come to pass that the spirits of the wicked,",
      "verse": "40:13",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 181.585,
      "end": 183.118,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, who are evil\u2014",
      "verse": "40:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 183.298,
      "end": 187.524,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, they have no part nor portion of the Spirit of the Lord;",
      "verse": "40:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 187.704,
      "end": 190.955,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, they chose evil works rather than good;",
      "verse": "40:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 191.135,
      "end": 194.897,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore the spirit of the devil did enter into them,",
      "verse": "40:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 195.077,
      "end": 197.678,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and take possession of their house\u2014",
      "verse": "40:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 197.858,
      "end": 201.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and these shall be cast out into outer darkness;",
      "verse": "40:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 201.335,
      "end": 205.097,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there shall be weeping, and wailing, and gnashing of teeth,",
      "verse": "40:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 205.277,
      "end": 210.385,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this because of their own iniquity, being led captive by the will of the devil.",
      "verse": "40:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 211.065,
      "end": 213.944,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this is the state of the souls of the wicked,",
      "verse": "40:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 214.124,
      "end": 221.508,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, in darkness, and a state of awful, fearful looking for the fiery indignation of the wrath of God upon them;",
      "verse": "40:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 221.688,
      "end": 223.592,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thus they remain in this state,",
      "verse": "40:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 223.772,
      "end": 228.37,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as well as the righteous in paradise, until the time of their resurrection.",
      "verse": "40:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 229.05,
      "end": 233.648,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, there are some that have understood that this state of happiness",
      "verse": "40:15",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 233.828,
      "end": 237.218,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this state of misery of the soul, before the resurrection,",
      "verse": "40:15",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 237.398,
      "end": 239.07,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "was a first resurrection.",
      "verse": "40:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 239.25,
      "end": 242.315,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I admit it may be termed a resurrection,",
      "verse": "40:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 242.495,
      "end": 252.433,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the raising of the spirit or the soul and their consignation to happiness or misery, according to the words which have been spoken.",
      "verse": "40:15",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 253.113,
      "end": 258.268,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, again it hath been spoken that there is a first resurrection,",
      "verse": "40:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 258.448,
      "end": 263.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a resurrection of all those who have been, or who are, or who shall be,",
      "verse": "40:16",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 263.597,
      "end": 266.894,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "down to the resurrection of Christ from the dead.",
      "verse": "40:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 267.574,
      "end": 270.871,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, we do not suppose that this first resurrection,",
      "verse": "40:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 271.051,
      "end": 273.327,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is spoken of in this manner,",
      "verse": "40:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 273.507,
      "end": 276.015,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "can be the resurrection of the souls",
      "verse": "40:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 276.195,
      "end": 278.889,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their consignation to happiness or misery.",
      "verse": "40:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 279.069,
      "end": 282.227,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ye cannot suppose that this is what it meaneth.",
      "verse": "40:17",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 282.907,
      "end": 284.672,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I say unto you, Nay;",
      "verse": "40:18",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 284.852,
      "end": 292.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but it meaneth the reuniting of the soul with the body, of those from the days of Adam down to the resurrection of Christ.",
      "verse": "40:18",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 293.473,
      "end": 297.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, whether the souls and the bodies of those of whom has been spoken",
      "verse": "40:19",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 297.786,
      "end": 300.247,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall all be reunited at once,",
      "verse": "40:19",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 300.427,
      "end": 302.656,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the wicked as well as the righteous,",
      "verse": "40:19",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 302.836,
      "end": 305.576,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I do not say; let it suffice,",
      "verse": "40:19",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 305.756,
      "end": 311.143,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I say that they all come forth; or in other words, their resurrection cometh to pass",
      "verse": "40:19",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 311.323,
      "end": 316.106,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "before the resurrection of those who die after the resurrection of Christ.",
      "verse": "40:19",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 316.786,
      "end": 317.993,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, my son,",
      "verse": "40:20",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 318.173,
      "end": 322.771,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I do not say that their resurrection cometh at the resurrection of Christ;",
      "verse": "40:20",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 322.951,
      "end": 325.552,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold, I give it as my opinion,",
      "verse": "40:20",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 325.732,
      "end": 332.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the souls and the bodies are reunited, of the righteous, at the resurrection of Christ,",
      "verse": "40:20",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 332.971,
      "end": 335.107,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his ascension into heaven.",
      "verse": "40:20",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 335.787,
      "end": 340.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But whether it be at his resurrection or after, I do not say;",
      "verse": "40:21",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 340.379,
      "end": 346.927,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but this much I say, that there is a space between death and the resurrection of the body,",
      "verse": "40:21",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 347.107,
      "end": 350.451,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and a state of the soul in happiness or in misery",
      "verse": "40:21",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 350.631,
      "end": 353.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until the time which is appointed of God",
      "verse": "40:21",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 353.365,
      "end": 358.798,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the dead shall come forth, and be reunited, both soul and body,",
      "verse": "40:21",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 358.978,
      "end": 361.161,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be brought to stand before God,",
      "verse": "40:21",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 361.341,
      "end": 363.663,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be judged according to their works.",
      "verse": "40:21",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 364.343,
      "end": 371.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, this bringeth about the restoration of those things of which has been spoken by the mouths of the prophets.",
      "verse": "40:22",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 372.268,
      "end": 374.544,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The soul shall be restored to the body,",
      "verse": "40:23",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 374.724,
      "end": 376.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the body to the soul;",
      "verse": "40:23",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 376.762,
      "end": 380.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and every limb and joint shall be restored to its body;",
      "verse": "40:23",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 380.379,
      "end": 383.63,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even a hair of the head shall not be lost;",
      "verse": "40:23",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 383.81,
      "end": 387.804,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but all things shall be restored to their proper and perfect frame.",
      "verse": "40:23",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 388.484,
      "end": 390.899,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my son, this is the restoration",
      "verse": "40:24",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 391.079,
      "end": 394.376,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of which has been spoken by the mouths of the prophets\u2014",
      "verse": "40:24",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 395.056,
      "end": 398.4,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then shall the righteous shine forth in the kingdom of God.",
      "verse": "40:25",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 399.08,
      "end": 402.377,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, an awful death cometh upon the wicked;",
      "verse": "40:26",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
